  "task": "We're anticipating a major storm surge that could impact coastal districts next week. First, assess flood risk and current drainage infrastructure status in all waterfront areas. Then, prioritize and fund emergency flood barrier installations where needed. Finally, coordinate preemptive work orders for drain maintenance and notify residents about preparedness measures."
